  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The J- PAL Learning for All Initiative: Testing the impact and cost-effectiveness of education interventions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Learning for All Initiative (LAI) will expand the scope of what the PPE Initiative offered, by accepting research proposals from a wider range of education interventions, from primary to secondary, focused on themes of girls&apos; education, foundational learning and the links between climate and education.</narrative>
  </description>
